     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Superlative",
     "texto": [
      "The superlative is usually formed with **naj-**: **najtańszy**, **najciekawszy**, **najwygodniejszy**.",
      "The adjective keeps agreement with the noun. When comparing within an area or group, **w** with the locative appears: **w okolicy**, **w mieście**."
     ],
